#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "October 2025 {#october-2025}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The IBM Quantum fleet welcomes `ibm_fez` and `ibm_marrakesh` to the Open Plan! All users can access these computers as of 27 October.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A reminder that `ibm_brisbane` will retire on 3 Nov 2025, so plan your experiments accordingly.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Learn quantum computing in your own language**: We're excited to announce that translations are now available across all documentation and learning pages on IBM Quantum Platform! Translations have been the most-requested feature in user feedback, and now, quantum learning and development are more accessible than ever.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Translations of **tutorials, courses, documentation, and announcements** are now available in seven languages: French, German, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese, and Spanish.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Multilingual search**: Use the search bar to find what you need in your preferred language.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Downloadable resources**: Download resources such as guides or tutorials in the language that suits you best.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Localized API references**: Explore the latest version of the API reference and REST APIs with fully translated documentation (current versions only).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Error messages & solutions**: Understand issues faster with translated error codes and suggested solutions.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Find a translation error? Let us know! [Submit a translation issue](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation/issues/new?template=translations.yaml) in our GitHub repo.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  *Note that there is a processing delay between the publication of new content and its translation, so you might only see the English version of recently released content for a few days while the translation is underway.*\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Learning in IBM Quantum Platform** now has an updated home page to help you navigate the educational resources available, as well as two new catalog pages to help browse courses and modules. [Check out the updates!](/learning)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"new-dynamic-circuits\"></span>\n"
"- The new dynamic circuits is now available to all users on all backends, except some QPUs under the On-Prem Plan.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  With this new version, you can run dynamic circuits at utility scale. The initial release offers the following features:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "75x execution speedup, thanks to the latest quantum execution stack\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Parallel branch execution, which reduces circuit duration and improves result quality\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support for [classical operations](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_classical) defined in Qiskit, with the exception of bit shift and arithmetic\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support for stretch duration in delay instructions. This new type allows design intent to be captured at circuit construction time, and timing resolution at compile time\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Additional features will be rolled out later this year.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  See  [Classical feedforward and control flow](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) and [Deferred timing resolution using stretch](/guides/stretch) for more information and code examples.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
