#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [Unitary Foundation Quantum Open Source Software survey](http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25) helps capture the needs and concerns of anyone who works with quantum software - including you! The survey results provide valuable feedback for our team of Qiskit developers, and helps us to understand the broader quantum software landscape.\n"
