#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Updated authentication error messages** - Error messaging has been improved for account and authentication processes to reduce issues with signup flow. The [Support page](/guides/support) has been expanded with recommendations for troubleshooting and resolving common errors.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Increased default data retention** - The default data retention period for the new IBM Quantum Platform has been increased to three years, up from one year on IBM Quantum Platform Classic.\n"
